data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":1438,"item_id":"msg_06f429219559b3d5016b0464e55c9487d1a7c6e2eb7eaef295","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"actor\\\":\\\"sol\\\",\\\"decision\\\":\\\"develop\\\",\\\"ability\\\":null,\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Develop the smallest evidence-bound apple assessment in the current-conversation handoff. Related capabilities were searched: probe already supplies paid nearby observation, consult supplies paid reading, and owned-hazelnut-assessment supplies a conservative exterior-evidence pattern. The latter is explicitly bound to Lin's hazelnut and is not executable on Sol's apple; probe alone does not specify the requested separation of exterior findings, food-safety evidence and unresolved preparation requirements. Search results are incomplete, so the handoff must check remaining related implementations before adding code, reuse any equivalent implementation and its existing learning duration if found, and record all reused handlers/helpers. No unsupported safety mechanism is required for this precursor: an explicitly inconclusive assessment is useful. Collection has already succeeded: item-125-sol-735 is one owned apple from forest-apple-2, harvested at tick 125; do not collect another or charge for collection again.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Current-conversation development handoff: implement a bounded, non-destructive exterior assessment and evidence-limit report, not an edibility test. Initial exact target is item-125-sol-735, owner sol, resource apple, quantity 1, origin forest-apple-2, harvestedAt 125. forest-apple-2 is provenance, not an additional input; its current stock 14 and mature stage do not certify the specimen. Revalidate actual identity, ownership, availability, local physical access, visibility, unreserved status and energy at execution; a stored position alone is not proof of access. An invalid or inaccessible target fails before payment and yields no observation. No tools, water, reagent, heat source, additional fruit or birch are supplied or needed. Study costs one personal round and 0.2 energy. Assess(specimenId, evidenceRefs=[]) costs one atomic work round and 0.2 energy for gentle exterior viewing/reorientation and recording; no tasting, deliberate sniffing of unknown material, skin challenge, pressing, wetting, heating, opening or sample removal. Record reuse of open.probe, revision foundation-open@1, handler open.probe, for the actual observe interaction where compatible; do not additionally charge a second probe action. Reuse the owned-hazelnut-assessment exterior-evidence machinery only after checking its implementation and adapting source applicability, not by copying hazelnut anatomy into an apple. Evidence references must be exact, complete, already personally accessible records; omitted, paged-incomplete or unavailable records remain unavailable. Obtaining further evidence uses separate actual consult actions under foundation-open@1 or independent communication; no automatic search of private records or hidden resource definitions. This release reports only represented, perceptible exterior features from a versioned source-appropriate observation model. If that model lacks a feature, report unavailable rather than invent it. Approximate body-scale geometry, if supported by the reused model, retains its resolution 0.02 and uncertainty 0.01 world-distance units and explicit model limitations; do not claim calibrated measurement. Never disclose decay=1.36461198 as an observed symptom or infer toxins, composition, interior health or nutritional value from private engine fields. The dated personal report has separate sections for performed method and direct exterior observations, supplied evidence relevant to identification/edibility, supported preparation information, and remaining uncertainty. Attach exact event and evidence references, observed tick, specimen identity and limitations to each claim. The word apple, a mature source, intact appearance or lack of visible damage does not establish food safety, nutrition or absence of toxins. With only the supplied facts, report that available methods cannot establish safety and that preparation requirements remain unestablished; do not invent washing, cooking or other effective treatment. No ingestion or eat invocation is included. Conservation: the same single specimen remains under the same ownership and location, with no material consumed, duplicated, restored or generated; no tree stock changes. Existing ageing and environmental rules continue normally. Output is a personal dated evidence record, not food, a safety certificate or a new specimen. Atomic work commits payment and observation together; interruption before commit creates no paid finding or charge, and resumption requires a fresh validated action. Cancellation before commit costs no inspection energy; after commit the record and paid effort persist with no refund. Death before commit aborts the action and leaves matter to ordinary death/ownership handling; death after commit never restores energy or specimen condition. No long-running task, reservation beyond the atomic interaction, passive assessment, maintenance charge or automatic reassessment exists. Later reassessment costs a new action and preserves earlier dated records rather than overwriting history. Review/development waiting advances no world time. Implement validation, conservation, uncertainty, evidence restrictions and lifecycle rules in code rather than requiring repeated model approval. No inventory, personal mastery, permission, consent, protection change or reward-account change is granted by this review.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Evaluate learning experience separately from physical or nutritional effects. Study, requests, naming, registration, capability lookup and unsupported assertions earn no experience benefit. A completed assessment may qualify only for genuinely new personally applicable verified exterior evidence, or an actually informative method limitation established by the paid examination; merely printing the predeclared inability to prove safety does not qualify. Reuse the existing grounded-understanding rule only if its actual executable contract is present: short source 0.8, aggregate cap 1, duration 8, cooldown 12, maintained gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015, subject to that rule's personal applicability and aggregation checks. If no such rule exists, award zero rather than creating a reward mechanism here. Deduplicate by canonical specimen, property, evidence state and method across probe and equivalent assessments; unchanged repetition gives no new gain. Familiar practice is not disqualified merely for lacking novelty, but this precursor grants no additional practice reward without an applicable existing bounded rule. No automatic pleasure, comfort, health, energy recovery, satiety or nutrition is produced; basic nutrition is not reduced by mood, physical comfort remains capped at 10, and protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions are unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit an assessment-start/abort or assessment-completed event only when the corresponding execution actually occurs. Reuse existing interaction rendering where supported and attach reusable visual metadata: actorId, specimenId, originId, eventId, method=exterior-observe, observedTick, stage, outcome, evidenceRefs and limitations. Completed means the observation/report completed, never that the food is safe. Render unavailable and inconclusive findings distinctly from affirmative measured findings; do not show safe/edible badges, internal anatomy, toxin readings or nutrition bars unsupported by evidence. Failed validation or interrupted work cannot display a completed assessment or award a success effect. Keep detailed findings private until Sol actually communicates them; public animation shows only the performed handling. Preserve the apple's actual appearance and ordinary ageing, with no invented glow, opening, damage, harvested stock or permanent marker.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

